1
00:00:01,089 --> 00:00:03,828
As Uke comes in towards you, offer the hand

2
00:00:04,329 --> 00:00:06,028
draw uke in towards your body 

3
00:00:06,529 --> 00:00:08,463
as he goes around you step forward,

4
00:00:08,464 --> 00:00:09,790
settle the weight

5
00:00:10,291 --> 00:00:11,531
raise both arms,

6
00:00:11,532 --> 00:00:17,323
as you do so turn the body all the way around 
so Uke goes completely around the body 
in a big circular movement

7
00:00:17,524 --> 00:00:18,578
control the wrist

8
00:00:18,779 --> 00:00:19,690
turn,

9
00:00:19,891 --> 00:00:22,743
as you turn 
maintain the same control of the wrist,

10
00:00:22,744 --> 00:00:24,602
the other hand controls the elbow

11
00:00:24,903 --> 00:00:26,005
turn Uke over,

12
00:00:26,306 --> 00:00:29,002
sit down with Uke´s shoulder 
in between your knees,

13
00:00:29,003 --> 00:00:32,980
control Uke´s wrist 
by pinning around into your shoulder,

14
00:00:32,981 --> 00:00:37,049
the other hand underneath then turn sharply 
towards Uke´s head for the pin

